# `?*.chock` and not `*.chock`: `*` matches the empty string, so that pattern hides all of `.chock/`,
# config and agents.md included, and a clone then runs no gates at all.
?*.chock
.*.tmp
.chock/verdicts.json
.chock/last-edit
rustc-ice-*.txt
